{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e7fbc2f4caab33c8","type":"text","text":"$\\hat\\beta_{GMM} = (X'Z\\hat W^{-1}Z'X)^{-1}X'Z\\hat W^{-1}Z'Y$\n\n$avar(\\sqrt n\\hat\\beta_{GMM})=\\Omega=(D'_0W^{-1}D_0)^{-1}D_0'W^{-1}V_0W^{-1}D_0(D'_0W^{-1}D_0)^{-1}$","x":-296,"y":-192,"width":546,"height":112,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"43f31167e7223ed2","type":"text","text":"$\\hat\\beta_{GMM} = \\left( X'Z (Z'\\Sigma Z)^{-1} Z'X \\right)^{-1} X'Z (Z'\\Sigma Z)^{-1} Z'Y$\n\n$\\Omega = (D_0'V_0^{-1}D_0)^{-1}=\\left(Q_{XZ}\\left[\\sigma^2\\left(\\dfrac{Z'\\Sigma Z}{n}\\right)\\right]^{-1}Q_{ZX}\\right)^{-1}$ ","x":564,"y":-300,"width":618,"height":323},
		{"id":"269bf8d30375643d","type":"text","text":"$\\hat\\beta_{IV} = (Z'X)^{-1}Z'Y$\n\n$\\Omega = \\sigma^2Q_{ZX}^{-1}Q_{ZZ}Q_{XZ}^{-1}$","x":612,"y":460,"width":522,"height":164},
		{"id":"a500d3e73e8d866d","type":"text","text":"$\\hat\\beta_{2SLS} = \\left( X'Z (Z'Z)^{-1} Z'X \\right)^{-1} X'Z (Z'Z)^{-1} Z'Y$\n\n$\\Omega = \\sigma^2(Q_{XZ}Q_{ZZ}^{-1}Q_{ZX})^{-1}$\n\n>*洪《高级计量经济学》P223：$\\Omega=\\sigma^2Q_{\\tilde X\\tilde X}^{-1}=\\sigma^2(Q_{XZ}Q_{ZZ}^{-1}Q_{ZX})^{-1}$ *","x":569,"y":164,"width":604,"height":164},
		{"id":"6d6f125ef4efd5a8","type":"text","text":"# 最小二乘法\n\n$\\hat\\beta=(X'X)^{-1}X'Y$\n\n$\\Omega=\\sigma^2Q_{XX}^{-1}$","x":710,"y":794,"width":310,"height":188},
		{"id":"e81b3bb38479c794","type":"text","text":"$\\hat\\beta=(X'X)^{-1}X'Y$\n\n$\\Omega = \\sigma^2Q_{XX}^{-1}\\left(\\dfrac{X'\\Sigma X}{n}\\right)Q_{XX}^{-1}$ \n\n\n\n","x":1557,"y":442,"width":327,"height":272},
		{"id":"bb70532e3ffa84ed","type":"text","text":"$\\hat\\beta_{IV} = (Z'X)^{-1}Z'Y$\n\n$\\Omega = \\sigma^2Q_{ZX}^{-1}\\left(\\dfrac{Z'\\Sigma Z}{n}\\right)Q_{XZ}^{-1}$  ","x":1437,"y":-107,"width":546,"height":264},
		{"id":"54109330aa28b212","type":"text","text":"# 两阶段最小二乘估计\n\n$\\hat\\beta_{2SLS} = \\left( X'Z (Z'Z)^{-1} Z'X \\right)^{-1} X'Z (Z'Z)^{-1} Z'Y$\n\n$\\Omega=(Q_{XZ}Q_{ZZ}^{-1}Q_{ZX})^{-1}Q_{XZ}Q_{ZZ}^{-1}V_0Q_{ZZ}^{-1}Q_{ZX} (Q_{XZ}Q_{ZZ}^{-1}Q_{ZX})^{-1}$\n\n>*洪《高级计量经济学》P225：$\\Omega=Q_{\\tilde X\\tilde X}^{-1}\\tilde VQ_{\\tilde X\\tilde X}^{-1}$*","x":-263,"y":130,"width":490,"height":358},
		{"id":"be3f85972d8bec6d","type":"text","text":"$\\hat{\\beta} = (X'ZZ'X)^{-1} X'ZZ'Y$\n\n$\\Omega = (Q_{XZ} Q_{ZX})^{-1} (Q_{XZ} V_0 Q_{ZX}) (Q_{XZ} Q_{ZX})^{-1}$","x":-236,"y":-503,"width":418,"height":126},
		{"id":"e05cd8d0b74f7698","type":"text","text":"$D_0=Q_{ZX}$\n\n$V_0=\\sigma^2\\left(\\dfrac{Z'\\Sigma Z}{n}\\right)$\n\n最优矩阵 $W=cV_0$ ，c为任意常数，故可以取 $Z'\\Sigma Z$ \n\n注意有些教材中， $\\sigma^2\\Sigma$ 是合并为 $\\Sigma$ 设置的\n\n$\\sigma$ 用以下估计：$\\hat e\\equiv Y-X\\hat\\beta$，其中，$\\hat\\beta$ 为 $\\beta_0$ 的无偏估计。\n","x":-612,"y":-44,"width":333,"height":338},
		{"id":"872c7eb2d97e892e","type":"text","text":"# 稳健标准误法\n\n$\\hat\\beta=(X'X)^{-1}X'Y$\n\n$\\Omega = Q_{XX}^{-1}\\hat VQ_{XX}^{-1}$ \n\n$\\hat V=\\dfrac{X'D(e)D(e)'X}n$ ，也即用 $D(e)D(e)'$ 替代 $\\sigma^2\\Sigma$ ","x":2091,"y":867,"width":418,"height":401},
		{"id":"adb3b57068a65384","type":"text","text":"# 广义最小二乘法\n\n$\\hat\\beta^*=({X^*}'X^*)^{-1}{X^*}'Y^*=(X'\\Sigma^{-1}X)^{-1}X'\\Sigma^{-1}Y$\n\n$\\Omega=\\sigma^2Q_{X^*X^*}^{-1}$\n\n拆解 $\\Sigma^{-1}=C'C$ 变换 $Y=X\\beta+\\varepsilon$ 为 $Y^*=X^*\\beta+\\varepsilon^*$ ，其中， $X^*=CX$ ，$\\Sigma^{-1}$ 可被两边的 $X'$ 、$X$ 吸收为 $X^*$ 、$X^*$ ，即为广义最小二乘法。\n\n值得一提的是，Σ 基本是不可知的。","x":2280,"y":370,"width":424,"height":329}
	],
